# CAT S22 (QM215/msm8937) flip phone. Smallest sibling target is 1 GB RAM, so
# this profile deliberately does not compose @base: no systemd, no resolved.
# First-party binaries (soil, hyphae, board scripts) arrive as an overlay or a
# signed package generation, not from Debian.
audio
bluetooth
core
modem
net-base
runit-init
ssh
wifi
